specific module. This might just be the workaround needed to resolve the immediate build failure.

I understand this change will temporarily disrupt the intended multi-module hierarchy. But, if it allows `task-web` to successfully build, it will provide a crucial foundation for me to 
then delve deeper into debugging the more fundamental issues with the multi-module inheritance and BOM management in the broader project.

