Summary: Add explicit Spring WebMVC and WebFlux dependencies to 
dependencyManagement in root pom.xml

Reasoning:
**Addressing Spring Vulnerabilities**

I've reviewed the latest scan results and the HIGH severity `CVE-2026-41842` 
persists. It seems merely setting the version property isn't sufficient. I plan 
