bytes (year component = 1000000 digits)\nParsed giant Duration in 11155 ms; 
years field type materialized as BigInteger\nRESULT: VULNERABLE - 1000000-digit 
BigInteger parsed from a 1000012-byte payload (amplified CPU/allocation, 
StreamReadConstraints bypassed)\n```\n\nInterpretation: a normal `\"P1Y\"` value
parses in tens of milliseconds; a ~1 MB attacker payload consumes **~11 s** and 
