amplification. The super-linear growth (≈26× cost for 5× payload) is consistent 
with the JDK's O(n²) `BigInteger(String)` constructor. The cost occurs inside 
`DatatypeFactory.newDuration`, downstream of jackson-core's `Stream<response 
